 373               /THIS ROUTINE DRAWS ANY ASCII SYMBOL ON THE PLOTTER.
 374               /IN ADDITION TO THE 96 ASCII SYMBOLS, THE CODES FOR
 375               /CR, LF AND BS ARE RECOGNIZED AND USED TO SIMULATE
 376               /THOSE FUNCTIONS.  SYMBOLS ARE BASED ON A 6 X 7 GRID
 377               /OF WHICH ONLY 4 X 6 IS USED.  SIZE 2 CHARACTERS ARE
 378               /THUS .08" X .12" WITH .04" BETWEEN THEM.  LF MOVES
 379               /0.1" X SIZE BELOW THE PRESENT LINE, BUT ONLY WORKS
 380               /UNTIL THE NEXT 'PLOT' COMMAND MOVES THE PEN.
